Z||000011||Monkeyman||10-02-2001||03:02 AM||||Ricecooker--Is your dash pocket black or is it a trick of the light?  Hard to tell, but it looks like mine (leather in front, cloth in the rear) except mine is gray and yours looks black.  I didn't know they made any like that in black.  I just painted my dash black so something like that would look good.  Is it factory or did you paint it?||||reg||1
Z||000012||RiceCooker||10-02-2001||03:38 PM||||Yes my dash pocket is black, I used a little piece of carpet leftover from my doors.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gul1.jpg">   <BR>It was actually my (former)gf's handywork - damn! how'd i let her get away! She took the stitching off the emblem and removed it then we hot glue gunned the black carpet to the old grey one after stitching the emblem to the new black piece.<BR>She did most of the work as i was installing my speakers  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <BR>All of the fiero emblems (seats, doors, steering wheel, pocket) are highlighted in silver too. A nice touch indeed.  ||||reg||1
